title: Proposition 12
---
order: 12
---
short_label: X.12
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: Magnitudes commensurable with the same magnitude are also commensurable with one another.
----
proof:

Let each of the magnitudes *A* and *B* be commensurable with *C.*

I say that *A* is also commensurable with *B.*

